\"弗里德里希·冯·艾森哈特\"] { content: url(\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/iseria_avatars/friedrich.png\"); }\n  img.pt-av[data-n=\"露易丝·维拉\"] { content: url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ayunsama/iseria-avatars@main/avatars/15.png?v=3\"); }\n  img.pt-av[data-n=\"露易丝\"] { content: url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ayunsama/iseria-avatars@main/avatars/15.png?v=3\"); }\n  img.pt-av[data-n=\"理查德\"] { content: url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ayunsama/iseria-avatars@main/avatars/32.png?v=2\"); }\n  img.pt-av[data-n=\"海雷丁\"] { content: url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ayunsama/iseria-avatars@main/avatars/hayreddin.png\"); }\n\n  </style>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      // 纯 CSS 已保证\"能点开 + 能切换 + 能改字号\"；本脚本仅做持久化记忆。\n      // ⚠️ 注意：本文件作为世界书/正则 HTML 注入消息时，<script> 会被\n      // SillyTavern 净化器剥离，此段不会执行 —— 那是\"每层楼回到默认\"的原因。\n      // 持久化已由「核心\\状态栏」脚本内置的《正文美化持久化补丁》负责：\n      // 它安装于宿主页面，监听主题/字号修改写入 localStorage，并对新楼层自动回放。\n      // 本段仅当脚本意外可执行时兜底（逻辑与补丁一致，幂等互不冲突）。\n      var radios = document.querySelectorAll('[data-parchment] input[name=\"pt-theme\"]');\n      var fonts = document.querySelectorAll('[data-parchment] input[name=\"pt-font\"]');\n      var saved = null, savedFont = null;\n      try { saved = localStorage.getItem('pt_theme'); } catch (e) {}\n      try { savedFont = localStorage.getItem('pt_font'); } catch (e) {}\n      if (saved) {\n        for (var i = 0; i < radios.length; i++) if (radios[i].value === saved) { radios[i].checked = true; break; }\n      }\n      if (savedFont) {\n        for (var j = 0; j < fonts.length; j++) if (fonts[j].value === savedFont) { fonts[j].checked = true; break; }\n      }\n      for (var a = 0; a < radios.length; a++) {\n        radios[a].addEventListener('change', function () { try { localStorage.setItem('pt_theme', this.value); } catch (e) {} });\n      }\n      for (var b = 0; b < fonts.length; b++) {\n        fonts[b].addEventListener('change', function () { try { localStorage.setItem('pt_font', this.value); } catch (e) {} });\n      }\n    })();\n  </script>\n</div>\n",
